You ain't Black, boy.

15:31.887 --> 15:33.671
But my dad's Black.

15:33.715 --> 15:35.064
Well, then have him come here,
and then I'll give him

15:35.108 --> 15:36.370
- the scholarship.
- Mm-hmm.

15:36.413 --> 15:37.458
Yeah, that nigga ain't go
to college.

15:38.633 --> 15:39.808
