15:44.552 --> 15:47.598
You are white!

15:49.165 --> 15:50.384
- Greg.
- You are-- You shut the fuck up!

15:50.427 --> 15:52.995
- You are white! You white!
- Hold on, Greg.

15:53.039 --> 15:55.911
He just told you, Blacks only.

15:55.955 --> 15:58.914
He couldn't answer any of
the questions, could he?

15:58.958 --> 16:01.395
- He's white!
- Hmm.

16:01.438 --> 16:03.005
Off-white.

16:03.049 --> 16:04.746
I knew he was white

16:04.789 --> 16:06.269
when he first walked up in here.

16:06.313 --> 16:08.010
And he ain't got
no Black friends.

16:08.054 --> 16:09.098
How you know that?

16:09.142 --> 16:11.535
I'll tell you why come I know.

16:11.579 --> 16:14.103
'Cause if he did have
some Black friends,

16:14.147 --> 16:16.062
they would have told
his white ass

16:16.105 --> 16:17.977
not to come walking up in here

16:18.020 --> 16:21.545
with them Matcha-colored
Allbirds. Mm-hmm.

16:21.589 --> 16:24.766
How long you been coasting
on your whiteness, son?

16:24.809 --> 16:27.421
- See, I used to know a guy
like you back in the day.
- Mm-hmm.

16:27.464 --> 16:29.031
His name was Clarence Thomas.

16:29.075 --> 16:31.207
Oh, shit.

16:31.251 --> 16:33.601
- He got his.
- Clarence Thomas?

16:33.644 --> 16:35.081
You just got yours.

16:35.124 --> 16:38.736
Case dismissed.

16:38.780 --> 16:40.521
Now, take your ass
on out of here.

16:42.610 --> 16:44.090
You didn't have to
call the boy Clarence Thomas.

16:44.133 --> 16:45.004
Shit, he ain't that white.

16:52.011 --> 16:53.360
This guy's a psycho!

16:53.403 --> 16:54.752
I'm not Black
because I have white friends?

16:54.796 --> 16:56.537
- We should sue him.

16:56.580 --> 16:58.365
I'm serious.
Is this funny to you?

16:58.408 --> 17:00.062
- A little bit, yeah.
- Dad,

17:00.106 --> 17:02.021
I won't get to go to college
because this guy's racist,

17:02.064 --> 17:04.458
or colorist or whatever.
Fuck this dude!

17:04.501 --> 17:07.156
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.
Calm down, kemosabe.

17:08.636 --> 17:11.291
Relax, some-- I mean,
that's part of being Black.

17:11.334 --> 17:13.684
Sometimes you don't get
the things you know you deserve.

17:13.728 --> 17:15.599
So, just charge it to the game.

17:15.643 --> 17:17.253
Hey, listen, uh, I'm gonna be
at the workshop tonight,

17:17.297 --> 17:19.168
so I'll be home a little late.

17:19.212 --> 17:21.562
So, if you could take out...

17:21.605 --> 17:24.782
Hey? You good?

17:24.826 --> 17:26.393
Who is D'Andre
and why are you talking to him?

17:26.436 --> 17:27.742
I wasn't.

17:27.785 --> 17:29.352
He commented on my page.

17:29.396 --> 17:32.268
But you responded.
I literally saw you respond.

17:32.312 --> 17:34.357
Would you chill?
I met him on a school tour.

17:34.401 --> 17:36.838
- It's not a big deal.
- Don't tell me to chill.

17:36.881 --> 17:38.840
If this was some chick
I met on tour at ASC,

17:38.883 --> 17:40.494
you'd be livid
and you fucking know it.

17:40.537 --> 17:42.800
No, I wouldn't, 'cause I know
you're not going to ASC.

17:44.715 --> 17:45.934
What?

17:47.327 --> 17:49.938
Look, Aaron...

17:49.981 --> 17:52.071
I know you're not going.

17:54.160 --> 17:57.293
You kept pushing it off, and...

17:57.337 --> 18:01.036
I know you haven't applied
for loans, and...

18:01.080 --> 18:02.733
I know you don't
have the money.

18:04.039 --> 18:06.694
You're just...

18:06.737 --> 18:09.175
not going, and...

18:12.178 --> 18:14.702
...we should just...

18:14.745 --> 18:16.660
end this now.

18:20.055 --> 18:21.839
What are you saying?

18:24.277 --> 18:26.279
I think we should break up.

18:28.759 --> 18:31.284
I'm sorry, Aaron.

18:32.459 --> 18:35.853
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

18:52.131 --> 18:53.567
Dog shit.

18:55.177 --> 18:56.135
Man, this nigga's scared.
I can feel it.

18:58.746 --> 19:00.487
This nigga's trash.

19:01.792 --> 19:03.794
Get him out of here.

19:03.838 --> 19:05.666
I am going to pay

19:05.709 --> 19:08.234
