college tuition...

19:08.277 --> 19:09.496
You ready to die, white boy?

19:09.539 --> 19:11.106
...who's Black.

19:13.108 --> 19:14.805
You are white!

19:16.851 --> 19:19.680
He just told you, Blacks only.

19:19.723 --> 19:22.335
You are white! You white!

19:22.378 --> 19:23.858
I mean,
that's part of being Black.

19:23.901 --> 19:25.729
Sometimes you don't get
the things you know you deserve.

19:25.773 --> 19:26.991
You are white! You white!

19:29.994 --> 19:31.518
You are white!

20:36.800 --> 20:38.846
Who are you?

20:38.889 --> 20:41.457
Felix. Who are you?

20:43.024 --> 20:44.417
What are you doing?

20:45.722 --> 20:46.984
I'm about to burn
this motherfucker down.

20:47.028 --> 20:48.377
What are you doing?

20:49.726 --> 20:51.685
He said you weren't Black, too.

20:55.123 --> 20:57.560
My parents are from Nigeria.

20:57.604 --> 20:59.693
I was born there,
but I don't even remember it.

20:59.736 --> 21:00.868
I'm from Lithonia.

21:00.911 --> 21:03.131
Hmm.

21:04.219 --> 21:05.829
Hmm.

21:05.873 --> 21:08.223
- I get it.
- Get what?

21:08.267 --> 21:10.486
I understand what he means.

21:10.530 --> 21:12.836
You're not really Black.

21:12.880 --> 21:14.925
You have an entire culture
to pull from.

21:14.969 --> 21:17.798
You know where you're from,
you can trace your lineage,

21:17.841 --> 21:20.104
