to go home to.

21:20.148 --> 21:22.150
That's not really Black.

21:22.193 --> 21:23.325
Well, I'm Blacker than you.

21:23.369 --> 21:25.371
You look like fucking
Frankie Muniz.

21:26.981 --> 21:28.635
You think if I walk down
the street in your neighborhood,

21:28.678 --> 21:30.724
